# environments/<env>/terraform.tfvars files ARE committed (real
# convention, mirrored from sm-infraforge/langfuse) - they never contain
# secrets (btp_username/btp_password/xsuaa_xsappname are HCP Terraform
# workspace variables instead, see infra/terraform/README.md). Only a
# stray/local tfvars dropped outside environments/ is ignored, as a
# guard against accidentally committing a personal override.
/infra/terraform/terraform.tfvars
/infra/terraform/*.auto.tfvars
